        <section id="approach" class="validation">
          <div>
            <span class="section-kicker">
              The investigation loop
            </span>
            <h2>
              Make a scientific case
            </h2>
            <p>
              Formulate a hypothesis, design a small experiment, collect measurements, fit or revise a model, estimate uncertainty, and compare a prediction with a new observation. The goal is reasoning supported by evidence, not code volume.
            </p>
          </div>
